9EE2EE76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631110004:1":{"text":"하암...","source_cn":"哈啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BB19A61862BE1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631110005:1":{"text":"그래, 입안이 열리고 연구개가 올라가는 느낌이 들지? 그 느낌을 유지한 채로 다시 해봐.","source_cn":"对，感受一下那个口腔内部打开、软腭抬起来的感觉了吗？用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C0A5C1710D73B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631110006:1":{"text":"랄라...","source_cn":"啦啦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AF2B67194FD67D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631110007:1":{"text":"오, 이번에는 훨씬 느낌이 더 좋아졌어. 먼저 조금 더 연습해 보렴.","source_cn":"噢，这次感觉更好了。你先练习一会吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD4B7C8DAC6FB8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1631110007":{"text":"오, 이번에는 훨씬 느낌이 더 좋아졌어. 먼저 조금 더 연습해 보렴.","source_cn":"噢，这次感觉更好了。你先练习一会吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD4B7C8DAC6FB8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631110008:1":{"text":"그래, 살아있을 때는 성악 교수였지.","source_cn":"是的。在我生前，曾是一位声乐老师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C693B6BA1BB55FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631110009:1":{"text":"그리고 노래의 재능이라는 건 하늘이 내려주는 선물이야. 크리스틴처럼 뛰어난 재능을 가진 학생을 만나는 건, 교수에게 있어서 빛나는 보물을 발견하는 것과 같지.","source_cn":"而歌唱天赋，终究是天赐的礼物。能遇到克莉丝汀这样天赋极...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1ABE0A89AA0F912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631110010:1":{"text":"올바른 가르침만 받는다면, 크리스틴은 분명 에스페리아에서 크게 빛날 거야!","source_cn":"我相信，只要经过恰当的引导，她一定会在伊索米亚大放异彩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x096036604829D20B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"저 애는 네 학생이야?","source_cn":"她是你的学生吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x95A2A0C0F20CA08E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저 애는 네 학생이야?","female":"저 애는 네 학생이야?","variant_male_record_index":"84971","variant_female_record_index":"84972","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"넌 여기 교수님이었어?","source_cn":"你是这里的老师？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x168BAEE3C893E7B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"넌 여기 교수님이었어?","female":"넌 여기 교수님이었어?","variant_male_record_index":"84973",